bonetworks.com\nInvendis Technologies India Private Limited\nNo. 230, 1st Cross, 38th Main, BOOHBCS Layout, BTM\n2nd Stage, Bangalore – 560 068\n110 mm\n44 mm\n110 mm\n44 mm"
